@startuml

title Получение текущей температуры

actor User

participant "Telemetry API" as API
participant "Telemetry Service" as Service
participant "Telemetry Repository" as Repository
participant "Temperature API Client" as Client
participant "Temperature API" as TemperatureAPI
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> API : GET /telemetry/{deviceId}

API -> Service : getTelemetry(deviceId)

Service -> Repository : getSensor(deviceId)

Repository -> DB : SELECT sensor

DB --> Repository : Sensor

Repository --> Service : Sensor

Service -> Client : getTemperature(sensor.location)

Client -> TemperatureAPI : GET /temperature?location=<<location>>

TemperatureAPI --> Client : Temperature

Client --> Service : Temperature

Service --> API : TelemetryResponse

API --> User : 200 OK\nvalue, unit, status, lastUpdated

@enduml